    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88787" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσβῐ-άζομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>compel, constrain</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινα</span>
